{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791067920, "covers_from": "2026-10-03T22:52:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-03T22:53:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791067980, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-03T22:52:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 29889, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "萬華是台北舊城區\n外國人很喜歡來玩\n但也是五流的區域\n怎麼可以驕傲的歡迎外國觀光客來玩\n是個大功課", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.29,889", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T22:52:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36067, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "環境", "content": "完整規劃吸煙禁菸區。禁止邊走邊抽煙。作到東京那樣。", "display_name": "大同代表 No.36,067", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T22:52:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 1151, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "臺北就集中區域很發達，其他地方破到一個不行，然後很多老房看起來就超危\n看起來超危就算了，租房價格也恐", "display_name": "信義代表 Luna Syu ⁺ ⊹", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T22:52:38+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35635, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "有欒樹風景有自己特色故事的天母，比在芝山站到棒球場一公里的路不到蓋捷運部門城市特色。棒球可增加公車班", "display_name": "士林代表 No.35,635", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T22:52:53+00:00", "duration_seconds": 7, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 17581, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "蟑螂真的太多了，超級擾民🥲🥲", "display_name": "士林代表 No.17,581", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 36067, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.36,067", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 1151, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "display_name": "信義代表 Luna Syu ⁺ ⊹", "di